...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

gen_tool: 렌더링 생성 도구 (generate_renovation_rendering) { class: ours }
project_coordinator: 프로젝트 코디네이터 (ProjectCoordinator) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

gen_tool -> project_coordinator: 성공 메시지 반환
project_coordinator -> gemini: function_response
gemini -> project_coordinator: 최종 계획 텍스트
